import math
x,y=map(int, input().split())#fisherman's point
n=int(input())
s=10000000
x0=0#smallest x point
y0=0#smallest y point
for i in range(n):#smallest range
    x1, y1=map(int,input().split())#the point of a school of fish
    a=abs(x-x1)#absolute value
    b=abs(y-y1)#absolute value
    s1=math.sqrt(a*a+b*b)#sqare root
    if s1<s:
        s=s1
        x0=x1
        y0=y1
print(x0,y0)
